# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Run outputs (P0-3). Everything below is WRITTEN by the app, the CLI or a test
# and re-read only within the same run - nothing here is a fixture.
# The tracked test DATA lives in blastlab/tests/baseline/, foam_fixtures/ and
# foam_golden/ and is deliberately NOT matched by these patterns
# (the baselines are named b1_*/b2_*/b3_*/transcript.txt).
# Do not add logo.gif here: it is a GUI asset (gui/app.py::_LOGO).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Run/workspace directories
/run/
/chain_workspace/
blastlab/chain_workspace/

# Cases and gauge/profile outputs
/case.json
gauges.txt
gauges_1d.txt
gauges_2d.txt
gauges_3d.txt
